                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='197' h='3300' id='12' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type-v2='paramctrl' w='15530' x='8030' y='400'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='264' forceUpdate='true' h='13600' id='213' type-v2='text' w='98788' x='606' y='3700'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Quick Guide for Q2 OKR:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> &quot;Reduce share of KVI Items with price markup measured against Dmart benchmark (MENA)&quot;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- The list of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>KVI</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> items is taken from Supermarket SKUs over Q2 2023 from 7 markets in Talabat in the Item Role dashboard </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- In the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Perspective</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> dropdown, please select the granularity you want to see: Region, Country and etc.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- In the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Benchmark Type</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> dropdown, Dmart Weighted Average of Sold Prices is selected.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- In the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Below Benchmark Flag</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> dropdown, only True and False are selected. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>False</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> means items have price markup. There are many products under </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Null</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> if Null is selected, since these products are not sold by Dmart, we are not able to determine the Dmart benchmark of these products, hence, these products appear under Null.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- In the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Talabat Vertical Type</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> dropdown, only Groceries, Hypermarket and Supermarket are selected.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- The Start Value of the Q2 OKR is taken based on </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>Date of Listed Price</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'> = 31.03.2023.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial'>- The percentage and number of products are calculated based on the Global Product ID (the most granular level), since one Master ID can have multiple Global Product IDs.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='3300' id='154' mode='checkdropdown' name='Item Role: % SKUs below benchmark' param='[federated.0iy36780hye0iu1cc2x2v0w9qxjj (copy 2)].[none:Calculation_382665296199548930:nk]' show-apply='true' type-v2='filter' w='10833' x='23560' y='400'>
